  "notes_zh": [
    "一次只能填一个列表 URL（App 只存一个 Repo URL 槽位），换档位/换生态就换 URL。",
    "全量列表里每个源的名称下方会显示档位、延迟、收录生态数。",
    "主用 jsDelivr @main；它有缓存（最长约 12 小时），想立刻拿到当前快照用 @<sha> 固定地址。",
    "raw.githubusercontent 在部分网络（含中国大陆）会超时，仅作最后备选。",
    "「按生态」是重叠分类：一个源覆盖的站点可能同时被多个生态收录，所以各生态的源数相加会大于总数。",
    "含 NSFW 源，不需要的在 App 里单独关掉。",
    "源指向第三方站点，可用性与合规性请自行判断。"
  ],
  "notes_en": [
    "Only one list URL can be set at a time (the app stores a single Repo URL).",
    "In the all-list, each entry shows tier / latency / ecosystem count under its name.",
    "Primary is jsDelivr @main (cached up to ~12h); use @<sha> for the exact snapshot.",
    "raw.githubusercontent times out on some networks (incl. mainland China) — last resort.",
    "Ecosystem groups overlap: one source may cover sites indexed by several ecosystems, so the per-ecosystem counts sum to more than the total.",
    "Includes NSFW sources; disable the ones you don't want in the app.",
    "Sources point to third-party sites — availability and legality are your call."
  ]
}